{
	"id": "sotdq",
	"name": "sotdq",
	"title": "Dragonlance: Shadow of the Dragon Queen",
	"description": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">Enlist in the War of the Lance</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:2,&quot;335551620&quot;:2,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:72,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;54f82acd-7e7d-445d-9ab1-fcf792f67383|63&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[469775450,&quot;Core Body&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134234082,&quot;true&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;CoreBody&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Cambria&quot;,469777842,&quot;&quot;,469777843,&quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ Pro W3&quot;,469777844,&quot;Cambria&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Cambria,ヒラギノ角ゴ Pro W3&quot;,335551500,&quot;0&quot;,268442635,&quot;20&quot;,335559705,&quot;1041&quot;,469777462,&quot;187&quot;,469777927,&quot;0&quot;,469777928,&quot;1&quot;,335559739,&quot;200&quot;,134233279,&quot;true&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}\">Takhisis</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">&nbsp;the Dragon Queen has returned to the world of Krynn. Across the land, her armies of fanatical&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">draconians</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">&nbsp;wage a brutal war of conquest. As the Dragon Armies march on the unprepared nation of&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">Solamnia</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">, only the defenders of the city of&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">Kalaman</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">&nbsp;stand in their way. But the Dragon Armies want more than just to crush their foes. An ancient evil in the Dragon Queen&rsquo;s service seeks a magical weapon that could dominate Krynn for all time.</span></span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">Dragonlance</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">: Shadow of the Dragon Queen is a tale of conflict and defiance set during the legendary War of&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">the Lance</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">. Create characters from Krynn, the world of the&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">Dragonlance</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Core Body\">&nbsp;setting, then march them to the front lines of battle against the terrifying Dragon Armies.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:200,&quot;469777462&quot;:[187],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[1]}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">Introduces the Kender race</span></b><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;for player characters to use in the D&amp;D Beyond character builder</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Adds&nbsp;the Lunar Sorcery subclass&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">to</span><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;imbue&nbsp;sorcerers&nbsp;with lunar magic from Krynn's three mystical moons</span></li>\r\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">Brings new&nbsp;backgrounds like&nbsp;<b><span data-contrast=\"none\">the Knights of Solamnia and Mages&nbsp;of High Sorcery</span></b> </span></b><span data-contrast=\"none\">to use in character creation</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Gives Dungeon Masters everything they need to run D&amp;D campaigns set in&nbsp;</span><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">Dragonlance&nbsp;</span></b><span data-contrast=\"none\">during the</span><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;War of the Lance</span></b><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Fight against legendary villains like&nbsp;</span><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">Lord Soth and legions of draconians, dragons, and other servants of the Dragon Queen</span></b><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;in the encounter builder</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Brings war as a genre&nbsp;of play to Dungeons and Dragons</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;fifth edition</span></li>\r\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559684&quot;:-2,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Contains a&nbsp;</span><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">poster map</span></b><span data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;depicting the&nbsp;</span><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">continent of Ansalon and the Kalaman theater of war.</span></b><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">This purchase unlocks the contents of this sourcebook&nbsp;for use with D&amp;D Beyond, including the book in digital format in the game compendium and access options from the book in the searchable listings, encounter builder, character builder, and digital sheet.&nbsp;</span></p>",
